TEST DATA
- Property manager: properties 1-5. Options 8 and 9 list every tenant and every property. This was done to make it easier to find tenants and properties for testing.
- Layla Sato with ID 30 owes about $10,000. Use her for "Check amount due" and payments.
- Tenants 41-55 are prospects with no lease. Prospective tenant 41 has toured unit 5-205, so you can sign a lease for her from property 5.
- Lease 3 (tenant 5, unit 1-201) has a move-out date set but not completed.

COMPANY MANAGER TESTS
