- Add 2 apartments to property 5. They are numbered 206-207.

FINANCIAL MANAGER TESTS
- Run each report. Outstanding balances lists Layla Sato (lease 37) first.
- Pay as tenant 30, then rerun the reports. The totals go up and her balance goes down.
